<% content_for :title, "Anger & Conflict Relapse Plan | Bipolar Sober" %>

<main class="relapse-plan-page">

  <section class="relapse-plan-hero">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <%= link_to "← ALL RELAPSE PLANS", toolbox_relapse_plans_path,
          class: "relapse-plan-back" %>

      <p class="relapse-plan-eyebrow">
        BIPOLAR SOBER / RELAPSE PLANS / ANGER &amp; CONFLICT
      </p>

      <h1>
        <span>PISSED OFF.</span>
        <span>STILL</span>
        <span>SOBER.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="relapse-plan-intro">
        MY SOBRIETY PLAN FOR ARGUMENTS, RESENTMENT &amp; SEEING RED.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-purple">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">01 / MY EXPERIENCE</p>
      <h2>ANGER ENTERS.<br>THEN WHAT?</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-copy">
        <p>[Write about anger, conflict, and how drinking enters your thinking.]</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-black">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">02 / MY BUILDUP</p>
      <h2>BEFORE THE<br>“FUCK YOU.”</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WHAT SETS ME OFF</h3>
          <p>[Write your personal triggers and situations.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WHAT I NOTICE FIRST</h3>
          <p>[Write your physical, mental, and behavioral warning signs.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-yellow">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">03 / MY CONFLICT PLAN</p>
      <h2>WHAT DO I DO<br>WITH THIS?</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY SPACE &amp; SAFETY PLAN</h3>
          <p>[Write your specific plan for stepping away and keeping everyone safe.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WORDS I CAN USE</h3>
          <p>[Write a boundary or a request for a break in your own words.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>THE DRINKING URGE</h3>
          <p>[Write what you will do when anger turns into wanting alcohol.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>WHO I CAN CALL</h3>
          <p>[Add support contacts and your backup.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-pink">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">04 / AFTER THE HEAT</p>
      <h2>WHAT STILL<br>NEEDS ATTENTION?</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-copy">
        <p>[Write your plan for follow-up, repair, boundaries, and additional support.]</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>